Generic single-database configuration for Alembic migrations.

This directory contains database migration scripts for the emailhandler project.

To run migrations:
    alembic upgrade head

To create a new migration:
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"

To downgrade:
    alembic downgrade -1

For more information, see the Alembic documentation:
https://alembic.sqlalchemy.org/
